text = "VOLTAIC CRYSTAL   difficulty 5/5\nfrom: mined\n\nA crystal that holds charge. Two crystals repel, so they won't sit together. It arcs into conductive metal and sparks off volatile items.\n\nCHALLENGE: It spreads itself out on belts and won't pile into a hopper. Ground it on copper before bulk handling, and never let it near sulfur."

